  | VectorIndex |   | Reranker     |   +----------------+
  | Docstore    |   | Docstore      |
  +-------------+   +---------------+
         |                  |
         v                  v
  +-------------+   +---------------+   +----------------+
  | FAISS       |   | SQLite        |   | sentence-      |
  | (adapter)   |   | (adapter)     |   | transformers   |
  +-------------+   +---------------+   +----------------+
```
